Reading: the weaker theory gains 11.5 bits per doubling of n (H_true pays (9-1)/2 log2 n in each of the three
formula contexts that H_narrow fixes, 12 log2 n; H_narrow pays 1/2 log2 n for one extra index weight) and overtakes Q + T_Ind near
n = 2^27.  This is the never-used-parts mechanism of the track's own section 2.3 / F3, and it lands the posterior on
the weaker side, not the L-infinity side.
